    <h1>Support</h1>
    <p>Sunalta is free and open source. You can explore the <a href="https://github.com/awaseem/sunalta">source code on GitHub</a>.</p>
    <p>Need help with Sunalta, found a bug, or have an idea? I’d love to hear from you.</p>
    <p>Reach out to Ali Waseem on X: <a href="https://x.com/softwarecuddler">@softwarecuddler</a>.</p>

    <h2>Reporting a problem</h2>
    <p>
      Please include your iPhone model, iOS version, Sunalta version, and a short description of what happened.
      If you can, include the steps to reproduce the issue. Keep personal information out of public posts.
    </p>
    <p>For details about your data, see our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
  </main>
